OL,3,GNEWSABattery waste warning after
OL,4,Aincrease in fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign urging people never to bin
OL,7,Fbatteries has been launched in
OL,8,FLeicestershire as fires caused by the
OL,9,Fdiscarded items continue to rise across
OL,10,Fthe UK.
OL,12,FAll of the county's district and
OL,13,Fborough councils have joined the drive
OL,14,Fto encourage locals to be more careful
OL,15,Fwhen throwing away items that may
OL,16,Fcontain hidden batteries, alongside
OL,17,FLeicestershire County Council.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
