OL,3,GNEWSABattery waste warning after
OL,4,Aincrease in fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the councils said
OL,7,Fmore everyday products contained
OL,8,Flithium-ion batteries such as vapes,
OL,9,Fmusical greeting cards and electric
OL,10,Ftoothbrushes.
OL,12,FStatistics from the Recycle Your
OL,13,FElectricals campaign, led by
OL,14,Fnot-for-profit organisation Material
OL,15,FFocus, show more than one in four fires
OL,16,F(26%) now happen in bin lorries.
